                                            Trachuk currently serves as General Counsel at WildBrain Ltd. (TSX:WILD) a global media,
                                            animation studio, production, and brand licensing company. Prior to joining WildBrain, Mr.
                                            Trachuk was Counsel at Norton Rose Fulbright, a leading global law firm, where he practiced
