<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
following is a summary of the meetings of the Board and the meetings of the Audit Committee (as hereinafter defined) and CCG Committee
held during fiscal 2024 and the attendance at these meetings by the directors:</FONT></P>

